xercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_s9HZznU7Fk2fAne4zv8oqw">71.40</ix:nonFraction>. The Company offered the holders of the June 2026 Existing Warrants an inducement period whereby the Company agreed to issue new warrants (the &#8220;June 2026 Inducement Warrants&#8221;) to purchase up to a number of shares of common stock equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_UXaMtE6o50yb7FmNbfdzEw" contextRef="Duration_6_8_2026_To_6_8_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_June2026InducementWarrantsMember_UuH8VUTKtkmn2GDjaw3d-Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRightsPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_5dn2I6kUHk2CVU83Nra84w">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the number of shares of common stock issued pursuant to the exercise by the holders of the June 2026 Existing Warrants, for cash, at a reduced exercise price equal to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="As_Of_6_8_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_June2026InducementWarrantsMember_1xWgG91nJkuSRwjFfJrfZA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_F_mwo9Cr9ki_8fvb90BRtg">9.252</ix:nonFraction>. Each holder agreed to exercise all of their June 2026 Existing Warrants immediately. The Company received aggregate gross cash proceeds of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_6_8_2026_To_6_8_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_June2026ExistingWarrantsMember_V1G1BjMqgk68xuCip0gqEQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromWarrantExercises" scale="3" id="Narr_2JXnQcyH202XBcGw_x2DuA">463</ix:nonFraction> after redemption of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_6_8_2026_To_6_8_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_2q68Urh7oUWcm4Cq86lYAg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsForRepurchaseOfPreferredStockAndPreferenceStock" scale="3" id="Narr_LBeGhFOOsEakTKe_-kRevA">2,010</ix:nonFraction> or <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="Duration_6_8_2026_To_6_8_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_2q68Urh7oUWcm4Cq86lYAg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_mpCLUpwyskaaObSLMOfVRg">2,010</ix:nonFraction> shares of Series B Preferred Stock from the exercise of the June 2026 Existing Warrants. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">To account for the redemption of Series B convertible preferred stock in accordance with ASC 260-10-S99-2, the Company recorded a reduction of Capital in excess of par value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_6_8_2026_To_6_8_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_AdditionalPaidInCapitalMember_RcMJcpnDjEWgWBvWKzO5uA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodValue" scale="3" id="Narr_dbJkwkhgGUKa_zmwcrEYtA">1,140</ix:nonFraction> to extinguish the carrying value of the Series B convertible preferred stock and a dividend to the holders of the Series B convertible preferred stock of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_6_8_2026_To_6_8_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_2q68Urh7oUWcm4Cq86lYAg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RedeemablePreferredStockDividends" scale="3" id="Narr_rJUTKJL1o0uu7yfVy09H3Q">870</ix:nonFraction>, which is a deduction in net income (loss) to arrive at income (loss) available to common shareholders (see Note 11 &#8220;Loss Per Common Share&#8221;).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">The Company measured the fair value of the June 2026 Existing Warrants before and after the modification to decrease the cash exercise price, and concluded there was an increase in fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_6_8_2026_To_6_8_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_June2026ExistingWarrantsMember_V1G1BjMqgk68xuCip0gqEQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DeemedDividends" scale="3" id="Narr_RZVobnd9NUO-dLebmTqZ_g">540</ix:nonFraction> recorded as a deemed dividend.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">The provisions of the June 2026 Inducement Warrants regarding stock combination events were triggered as a result of the <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_7QJKlPiHcUG9FFuSJCIZBA;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">1</span></span>-for-20 reverse stock split on June 12, 2026. The anti-dilution adjustment resulted in the issuance of an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="Duration_6_12_2026_To_6_12_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_June2026InducementWarrantsMember_lBpcwE2bqU6l72sUnbBzkA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_GdyMRVJA4E2X6sDH6Zp6TA">2,752,302</ix:nonFraction>&#160;Inducement Warrants and a deemed dividend from issuance of the Inducement Warrants of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_6_12_2026_To_6_12_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_June2026InducementWarrantsMember_lBpcwE2bqU6l72sUnbBzkA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DeemedDividends" scale="3" id="Narr_JPpQVZywt0ypDSo_2lFaMg">17,005</ix:nonFraction>. Stockholder approval for issuance and terms of the June 2026 Inducement Warrants is required to be obtained at the August 5, 2026 Special Meeting of the Stockholders.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-bottom:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">On August 13, 2026, the Company entered into an amendment with the holders of all of the outstanding June 2026 Inducement Warrants whereby the exercise price was reduced to $0.3675 and to allow all of the June 2026 Inducement Warrants to be exercised on a cashless basis. Following the amendment, all <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="Duration_8_14_2026_To_8_14_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_June2026InducementWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_V37AcmII3E6bbj5jABoPFw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:NumberOfWarrantsExercisedOnCashlessBasis" scale="0" id="Narr_s5_CCi51LU6h6nDqGolcLQ">3,019,586</ix:nonFraction><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;"> warrants were exercised on a cashless basis for an aggregate of 2,742,397 shares of common stock, with 2,531,242 of such shares held in abeyance.  Following the exercise, no warrants remain outstanding. See Note 13 &#8220;Subsequent Events&#8221; for additional information.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#212529;font-style:italic;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#212529;font-style:italic;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><i style="color:#212529;font-style:italic;">March 2026 Series B Convertible Preferred Stock Offering</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On March 20, 2026, the Company and certain investors entered into a securities purchase agreement with respect to the offer and sale of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_L2yCbtYWwkOHszDb3GQLsQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:AggregateOfferingPrice" scale="3" id="Narr_HFe1O4b-ZEqUj-8SeyCxTQ">20,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;of shares of Series B Convertible Preferred Stock, stated value $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="As_Of_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_Ma3bruvIa0-pozOkU1Fc8A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:PreferredStockStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_wkPGpV0BPU-yBM_cf08tLw">1,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;per share (the &#8220;Series B convertible preferred stock&#8221;), initially convertible into shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock at an initial conversion price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="As_Of_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_Ma3bruvIa0-pozOkU1Fc8A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockConvertibleConversionPrice" scale="0" id="Narr_fLJqpZK8NUG8WpOrG9sQnQ">71.40</ix:nonFraction>&#160;(subject to adjustment in certain circumstances with a floor price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_L2yCbtYWwkOHszDb3GQLsQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:PreferredStockConvertibleConversionPriceFloorPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_MIg0jf0qL0aKgWgWxui1pw">14.28</ix:nonFraction>) and, alternatively, at a&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_UXaMtE6o50yb7FmNbfdzEw" contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_L2yCbtYWwkOHszDb3GQLsQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:PreferredStockConvertibleConversionPriceDiscountPercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_dWmJUReX30eCPAEEmHXg-Q">15</ix:nonFraction>% discount to the lowest daily volume-weighted average price (&#8220;VWAP&#8221;) during the prior&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_ZHvu2VZ6kkChZQUCYitMGw" contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_L2yCbtYWwkOHszDb3GQLsQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:PreferredStockConvertibleConversionPriceThresholdTradingDays" scale="0" id="Narr_f9nypaUOEU-TliF_SeunNg">20</ix:nonFraction>&#160;trading days (the &#8220;Alternative Conversion Price&#8221;) and warrants to purchase shares of common stock pursuant to a registered direct offering. The Company has the ability to reset the fixed conversion price (lower), subject to board approval and the floor price. Stockholder approval for the offering was obtained at the February 20, 2026 Special Meeting of the Stockholders.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">At the initial closing, the investors purchased $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingTrancheOneMember_8EoPm1QiG0m9P9zz735lNQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_fxgG4vdE4kO-F6qKACVtrw">16,000</ix:nonFraction> of shares of Series B convertible preferred stock and warrants. The remaining <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="As_Of_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_Ma3bruvIa0-pozOkU1Fc8A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:StockIssuable" scale="0" id="Narr_6SX5sJfVOE24x4aN9HU9sQ">4,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Series B Preferred Stock and warrants are expected to be delivered at second closings, of which <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingTrancheTwoMember_KcqG-jKmnkq9X5OIn5Ebig" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_I8p3G9Vg0kOF68X7gtD65g">25</ix:nonFraction> shares have been purchased through June 30, 2026. The investors may request the second closing at any time until the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingTrancheTwoMember_KcqG-jKmnkq9X5OIn5Ebig" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="xxii:PreferredStockPeriodForOfferingFromPreviousTranche" id="Narr_XdDlDDsfLUqBqM1CCl8VCA">one-year</ix:nonNumeric> anniversary of the initial closing date and we may require the second closing at any time until the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingTrancheTwoMember_KcqG-jKmnkq9X5OIn5Ebig" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="xxii:PreferredStockPeriodForOfferingFromPreviousTranche" id="Narr_G6_htEYq6U23JYaTCicUAQ">one-year</ix:nonNumeric> anniversary of the initial closing date by individual investor once less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_UXaMtE6o50yb7FmNbfdzEw" contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingTrancheTwoMember_KcqG-jKmnkq9X5OIn5Ebig" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:PreferredStockThresholdPurchaseOfPreviousTrancheRequiredForNewOfferingPercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_iz1xjfq8QUaSQ4roPS-SoA">50</ix:nonFraction>% of such Investor&#8217;s Series B convertible preferred stock purchased at the initial closing remains outstanding and certain equity conditions have been satisfied for at least <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingTrancheTwoMember_KcqG-jKmnkq9X5OIn5Ebig" format="ixt-sec:durday" name="xxii:PreferredStockEquityConditionsMinimumRequiredDays" id="Narr_3XlSVf-aK0mG5tWEVfjt5A">7</ix:nonNumeric> of the prior <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingTrancheTwoMember_KcqG-jKmnkq9X5OIn5Ebig" format="ixt-sec:durday" name="xxii:PreferredStockEquityConditionsThresholdTradingDays" id="Narr_bTwAWRSuXkyyahMFXli6lw">10</ix:nonNumeric> trading days, including: (1) the common stock closes above <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_UXaMtE6o50yb7FmNbfdzEw" contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingTrancheTwoMember_KcqG-jKmnkq9X5OIn5Ebig" decimals="1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:PreferredStockEquityConditionsFloorPriceThresholdMultiplier" scale="0" id="Narr_TVV1Wz6ICU6qnkd-RmTwHg">2.5</ix:nonFraction> times the floor price and (2) the daily dollar trading volume of the Common Stock exceeds $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="As_Of_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingTrancheTwoMember_s66SaYHVC0ixntjGz8LSMA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:PreferredStockEquityConditionsMinimumDailyDollarTradingVolume" scale="0" id="Narr_8QIOkV3dIEK9-ZqjwQ9Ahw">500</ix:nonFraction>. The warrants are immediately exercisable at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="As_Of_3_20_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_March2026PreferredStockWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_nPaNEW2lhEKPnBqkP8hctQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_iDI4Md3wVEunCJf6mtsP8Q">71.40</ix:nonFraction> per share of common stock and expire on the date that is <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_3_20_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_March2026PreferredStockWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_nPaNEW2lhEKPnBqkP8hctQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" id="Narr_zNaFVTAKUEmZMq1fKe-bdg">five years</ix:nonNumeric> after issuance. In addition, the Company issued placement agent warrants to purchase an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="As_Of_3_20_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_PlacementAgentWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_CJn7cEDd7Em7BUrT8MqFcA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_pkN1J_-HS0KZFXBmvZNHkQ">9,412</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock with substantially the same terms as the Warrants, except that the exercise price of the Placement Agent Warrants is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="As_Of_3_20_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_PlacementAgentWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_CJn7cEDd7Em7BUrT8MqFcA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_Du_2Mbu19U-tU7I6Jr7jhQ">78.54</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">20</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_dad3710a_5bb5_48d1_8722_12eb43bae195"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_2rJ0-hNRYkaQKmpWhXg2_g_cont2" continuedAt="Tb_2rJ0-hNRYkaQKmpWhXg2_g_cont3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">The Company used the net proceeds from the offering to repurchase at par all of the shares of outstanding Series A convertible preferred stock issued in August 2025 in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_L2yCbtYWwkOHszDb3GQLsQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ProceedsFromPreferredStockUsedForRepurchaseOfTemporaryEquity" scale="3" id="Narr_qQnWMNEb6ECYoyFjI7BP5A">9,650</ix:nonFraction>. &#160;The balance of the net proceeds from the offering was approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_3_20_2026_To_3_20_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_March2026SeriesBConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_L2yCbtYWwkOHszDb3GQLsQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ProceedsFromPreferredStockNetOfAmountUsedForRepurchaseOfTemporaryEquityAndPlacementAgentCaseFees" scale="3" id="Narr_elHtRP5j0U2NEtLLM7miNg">5,680</ix:nonFraction>, after deducting placement agent case fees but before any other offering expenses. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-bottom:12pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">August 2025 Series A Convertible Preferred Stock Offering</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On August 22, 2025, the Company and certain investors entered into a securities purchase agreement with respect to the offer and sale of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_8_22_2025_To_8_22_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_mXTF26laJki0Zm83_U2L0g" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOrSaleOfEquity" scale="3" id="Narr_E6qLB6k3ekCKrrdWyiXOoQ">10,650</ix:nonFraction>&#160;of shares of Series A Convertible Preferred Stock, stated value $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="As_Of_8_22_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_wALio7t-rESbrf8koTrR-w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_J_B4hmSWYEuxn8bph5agjw">1,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;per share (the &#8220;Series A convertible preferred stock&#8221;), initially convertible into an aggregate of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="As_Of_8_22_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_wALio7t-rESbrf8koTrR-w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:TemporaryEquityConvertibleSharesIssuable" scale="0" id="Narr_q6tMZSe6y0qHuPB3-yjYzw">16,210</ix:nonFraction>&#160;shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock at an initial conversion price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="As_Of_8_22_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_wALio7t-rESbrf8koTrR-w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:TemporaryEquityConvertibleConversionPrice" scale="0" id="Narr_HlMswicwpkS7NeORfAIBHQ">657</ix:nonFraction>&#160;(subject to adjustment in certain circumstances with a floor price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="As_Of_8_22_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_August2025PreferredStockWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_F01KKbh4w0mGu5zis-Z-8g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:TemporaryEquityConvertibleConversionPrice" scale="0" id="Narr_H_8or-R7REmCSSX4Ebknkw">118.20</ix:nonFraction>) and warrants to purchase shares of Common Stock pursuant to a registered direct offering. The Investors purchased $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_8_22_2025_To_8_22_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_mXTF26laJki0Zm83_U2L0g" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOrSaleOfEquity" scale="3" id="Narr_5B0kwb7QY0OQmom4BBRYTA">10,650</ix:nonFraction>&#160;of shares of Series A convertible preferred stock and warrants. The warrants are immediately exercisable at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="As_Of_8_22_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_wALio7t-rESbrf8koTrR-w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_J5Je3UmDDEe6frfqTMoWqg">591</ix:nonFraction>&#160;per share of common stock and expire on the date that is&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_8_22_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_August2025PreferredStockWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_F01KKbh4w0mGu5zis-Z-8g" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" id="Narr_THqNNc5gDkKi8Mtk4DV92g">five years</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;after issuance. The net proceeds to the Company from the offering was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_8_22_2025_To_8_22_2025_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_N6aZzg9DVUqe3a8ocYvkqQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPreferredStockPreferenceStockAndWarrants" scale="3" id="Narr_JNuG9vV07USd_B4oV2WXgA">9,893</ix:nonFraction>. In addition, the Company issued placement agent warrants to purchase an aggregate of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="As_Of_8_22_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_wALio7t-rESbrf8koTrR-w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_Rw3guCSTFEOKg-gfV7u9WA">1,893</ix:nonFraction>&#160;shares of common stock with substantially the same terms as the warrants, except that the exercise price of the placement agent warrants is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="As_Of_8_22_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_PlacementAgentWarrantsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_smLeOX072UmCBKCIS0xJhg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_hmjyg3H3lkWIK1Pf8fq9rA">651</ix:nonFraction>. Following the offering,&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_fgj8kRBw7UqzXosn-ckn-A" contextRef="As_Of_8_22_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_PlacementAgentWarrantsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_smLeOX072UmCBKCIS0xJhg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_INjcxV4wwE-TUJcH5Zo7dQ">1,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;shares of Series A Preferred Stock were converted into&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="Duration_8_22_2025_To_8_22_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2025SeriesaConvertiblePreferredStockOfferingMember_mXTF26laJki0Zm83_U2L0g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_yPWzXA_Pg0mjwnAlIGyiMg">1,522</ix:nonFraction>&#160;shares of common stock.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On December 17, 2025, the Company entered into an Omnibus Amendment and Waiver (the &#8220;Amendment Agreement&#8221;) with the holders of the outstanding Series A convertible preferred stock to amend the Series A convertible preferred stock, the warrants and certain placement agent warrants issued in connection with the August 2025 offering described above.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Pursuant to the Amendment Agreement, the Company and the holders agreed to provide an alternative conversion feature to the Certificate of Designation whereby the Series A convertible preferred stock can be converted at a conversion price equal to&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_UXaMtE6o50yb7FmNbfdzEw" contextRef="Duration_12_17_2025_To_12_17_2025_rbZgcInBDk2kEvJoNX4Qbw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:TemporaryEquityConvertibleConversionPricePercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_-KIxnr_otEG6qa1l8gQ6yQ">85</ix:nonFraction>% of the lowest VWAP in any of the&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_ZHvu2VZ6kkChZQUCYitMGw" contextRef="Duration_12_17_2025_To_12_17_2025_rbZgcInBDk2kEvJoNX4Qbw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xxii:TemporaryEquityConversionPriceThresholdTradingDays" scale="0" id="Narr_mQ4gZTGT50uZ2s2Mssesww">twenty</ix:nonFraction>&#160;trading days preceding the conversion. &#160;Pursuant to the Amendment Agreement, the Company also agreed to provide certain anti-dilution adjustments to the exercise price of the warrants and placement agent warrants to provide protection against future dilutive issuances. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Following execution of the Amendment Agreement, the Company re-evaluated conclusions on classification and embedded features, resulting in no changes from the date of issuance of the Series A convertible preferred stock, as further described below. &#160;The impacts of the Amendment Agreement are accounted for as an extinguishment, as the fair value of the instruments before and after modification increased by greater than&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_UXaMtE6o50yb7FmNbfdzEw" contextRef="Duration_12_17_2025_To_12_17_2025_rbZgcInBDk2kEvJoNX4Qbw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:TemporaryEquityFairValueChangeOnModificationPercent" scale="-2" id="Narr__502JB8pp0O7T9xzBl7ZIQ">10</ix:nonFraction>%, resulting in the incremental value being recorded within Capital in excess of par value as a deemed dividend of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_12_17_2025_To_12_17_2025_rbZgcInBDk2kEvJoNX4Qbw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DeemedDividendRelatedToDownRoundProvisionsAndAntiDilutionProvisions" scale="3" id="Narr_kSXvcs9mdEqUelVaZ49ZMQ">4,679</ix:nonFraction> recorded in the period ended December 31, 2025.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Subsequent to December 31, 2025, stockholder approval for the provisions of the Amendment Agreement was obtained at the February 20, 2026 Special Meeting of the Stockholders. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On March 24, 2026, in connection with an offering of newly issued Series B convertible preferred stock, the Company redeemed all <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_rNK5x_yIzEWhZbEtqIVRKw" contextRef="Duration_3_24_2026_To_3_24_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_aouURt6Xv0yZI61cyzEx-Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_z6eHnm6Cuk-oFfWhoxyT-A">9,650</ix:nonFraction> shares of Series A convertible preferred stock at par in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_3_24_2026_To_3_24_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_aouURt6Xv0yZI61cyzEx-Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodValue" scale="3" id="Narr_Hn3WDhIuM0aaNgCujkz3jA">9,650</ix:nonFraction>. &#160;The Company evaluated the redemption to determine whether it is treated as an exchange transaction, assessing qualitative factors, to conclude whether the accounting would be a modification or extinguishment. &#160;The Company believes the changes in fixed conversion price and floor price of the Series B convertible preferred stock are so significant that the accounting should be an extinguishment of the Series A convertible preferred stock and issuance of new Series B convertible preferred stock. Therefore, in accordance with ASC 260-10-S99-2, the Company recorded a reduction of Capital in excess of par value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_3_24_2026_To_3_24_2026_lgz9ckDjBEyXoA2DjYqmWQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:StockReclassifiedDuringPeriodFromTemporaryEquityValue" scale="3" id="Narr_gqpK73JaJk-tV2q-Dblu0Q">2,734</ix:nonFraction> to extinguish the carrying value of the Series A convertible preferred stock and a dividend to the holders of the Series A convertible preferred stock of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Zamg5luc5U6ViI3i6nfphg" contextRef="Duration_3_24_2026_To_3_24_2026_lgz9ckDjBEyXoA2DjYqmWQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquityAccretionToRedemptionValueAdjustment" scale="3" id="Narr_44z7sSqQ80OemuSzIJaPsA">6,916</ix:nonFraction>, which is a deduction in net income (loss) to arrive at income (loss) available to common shareholders (see Note 11 &#8220;Loss Per Common Share&#8221;).</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">21</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="Tc_mo8P1x4hg0yM8kCqROLIEg_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_p2oJ3ochF0GjQMr8PecC1g_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_-4HsIeDIHE--5pre2G8t6g_1_7"></a><a id="Tc_5WTMUOyySES1_Uvl2ReJ5A_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_eelzEbWLZ0GhL8LekUZTXg_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_G5Hiwph5Yk6n5KgCsaYXhQ_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_Znyn-XiYl0GbdzIC9NWHag_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_tfIsPgXdLEq95_LYIsT8nQ_5_4"></a><a id="Tc_SWNsr-SCs0-UE67jI6bjdw_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_JlwAij-670C088B1ifxpLA_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_NVJRmsxrWUWXqxZZKijB_w_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_Y1B9pFVd1UmypPc4lc1LGQ_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_G79qKB4-QEiU9mid-LO4jg_9_4"></a><a id="Tc_hojWiLglbkaPBOgN30mCFw_10_0"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_2rJ0-hNRYkaQKmpWhXg2_g_cont3" continuedAt="Tb_2rJ0-hNRYkaQKmpWhXg2_g_cont4"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Mezzanine Classification</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">ASC 480-10-S99-3A(2) of the SEC's Accounting Series Release No. 268 ("ASR 268") requires preferred securities that are redeemable for cash or other assets to be classified outside of permanent equity if they are redeemable (i) at a fixed or determinable price on a fixed or determinable date, (ii) at the option of the holder, or (iii) upon the occurrence of an event that is not solely within the control of the issuer. Preferred securities that are mandatorily redeemable are required to be classified by the issuer as liabilities whereas under ASR 268, a company should classify a preferred security whose redemption is contingent on an event not entirely in control of the issuer as mezzanine equity. The Series A convertible preferred stock is redeemable at the option of the holder if "shareholder approval" (as defined in the agreements) is not obtained, which is not solely within control of the Company, and accordingly, the Company determined that mezzanine treatment is appropriate for the Series A convertible preferred stock. The Series A convertible preferred stock was initially measured at the amount of total proceeds less any offering costs and proceeds allocated to the accompanying warrants based on relative fair value, and was previously presented as such in the Condensed Consolidated Balance Sheets. Following stockholder approval at the February 20, 2026 Special Meeting of the Stockholders, the Company reclassified the carrying value of the Series A convertible preferred stock from mezzanine equity to permanent equity in accordance with ASC 480-10-S99-3A. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Further, upon issuance the Company evaluated all embedded features against an equity-like host and concluded none of the embedded features identified within the Series A and the newly issued Series B convertible preferred stock that may require bifurcation as they are either deemed clearly and closely related or not net settleable as a result of a lack of an active market.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Convertible preferred stock transaction activity is summarized in the table below:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Durat