cale="-2" id="Narr_TBMLOAAtDk6w828kngHHHQ">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the number of shares of common stock issued pursuant to the exercise by the holders of the Existing Warrants, for cash, at a reduced exercise price. Each holder agreed to exercise <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_UXaMtE6o50yb7FmNbfdzEw" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2025_To_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_LQ5mY0FkvESJxm-9OxQa_w" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightInitialExercisePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_caAz22vHcUyb4usOBfUXYA">60</ix:nonFraction>% of their Existing Warrants immediately (the &#8220;Initial Exercise&#8221;) and will exercise the remaining <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_UXaMtE6o50yb7FmNbfdzEw" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2025_To_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_LQ5mY0FkvESJxm-9OxQa_w" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePercentageAfterEffectivenessDate" scale="-2" id="Narr_LIhpqArib0600hEeph6pjA">40</ix:nonFraction>% within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_29_2025_To_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_LQ5mY0FkvESJxm-9OxQa_w" format="ixt-sec:durday" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExerciseTermAfterEffectivenessDate" id="Narr_SWjDHh3RdUmS2LenfmVeqw">30</ix:nonNumeric> calendar days following the Effectiveness Date (as defined in the agreements), provided that the Company&#8217;s stock price at such time equals or exceeds 90% of the Nasdaq Minimum Price on that date (the &#8220;Additional Exercise&#8221;). </p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">22</p></div></div>
